      "post_subject": "Coating plates?",
      "content_md": "I had to write a script to remove the posts I had to delete. This was not an available function of PHPbb. This left the search words database a little funky. When I get time I will regenerate the whole search database. Hopefully that will help. \n\nThe search function here is very simple and many of our posts have the same key words. It searches in reverse posting time order, not in thread order. It has a database of indexed words. The index is updated when you post. If I delete a post manually then it removes the index entry. If I write a script to delete 1100 posts based on poster id then the index remains unchanged. And actually I did not delete the posts I replaced the content with a line stating what happened to the posts.",
